<span id="S5.T1.4.14.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S5.T1.4.14.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">Every 250 epochs, 50,000 generated samples, FID at NFE </span><math id="S5.T1.m26" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{1,2,4\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mn mathsize="0.700em">1</mn><mo mathsize="0.700em">,</mo><mn mathsize="0.700em">2</mn><mo mathsize="0.700em">,</mo><mn mathsize="0.700em">4</mn><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{1,2,4\}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="S5.T1.4.14.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">.</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
